:crown-type
    a
        skos:Concept ,
        sosa:ObservableProperty ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy cs: ;
    skos:definition "Estimate the openness of individual tree or shrub crowns by matching the crown with a photograph. The rows show similar crown types for different leaf size (large to small, left to right). Acacia phyllodes is in the right hand column. Most Australian woody plants are in the range 40–70%."@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "Crown type"@en ;
    skos:topConceptOf cs: ;
.

